Adds your Listen voice agent's call button to every page of your website.

== Description ==

Your agent answers your visitors by voice, in their own dialect, day and night:
it answers questions from what you taught it and takes their name and phone
number for a callback. Change what it says, its voice and its knowledge in
Listen ({{HOME}}); the button on your website follows on its own.

== Installation ==

1. In WordPress, open Plugins, then Add New Plugin, then Upload Plugin.
2. Choose this zip file, click Install Now, then Activate.
3. That's it: open any page of your website to see the call button.

To hide the button, or to use another agent, open Settings, then Listen Voice Agent.

